{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35612","headline":"道李秀才入军 · 李山甫","name":"道李秀才入军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弱柳贞松一地栽，不因霜霰自难媒。\n书生只是平时物，男子争无乱世才。\n铁马已随红斾去，同人犹着白衣来。\n到头功业须如此，莫爲初心首重回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}